<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's KFA seeking 52,500 tonnes of corn - trade.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's KFA seeking 52,500 tonnes of corn - trade.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Korea Feed Association's (KFA) members in the city of Pusan have been negotiating with Cargill to buy 52,500 tonnes of corn, traders said on Thursday.</p>
<p>They said arrival was set for October 15 to the southeastern port of Pusan.</p>
<p>No more details were available.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
